{"id":66728,"date":"2025-09-06T12:09:47","date_gmt":"2025-09-06T11:09:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=66728"},"modified":"2026-09-04T14:20:12","modified_gmt":"2026-09-04T13:20:12","slug":"travessia-da-planicie","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/travessia-da-planicie\/","title":{"rendered":"8\u00aa Travessia da Plan\u00edcie 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">8\u00aa Travessia da Plan\u00edcie 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>8\u00aa Travessia da Plan\u00edcie 2026<\/strong> convida atletas e entusiastas da marcha a percorrer o cora\u00e7\u00e3o do Campo Branco no s\u00e1bado, <strong>24 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, \u00e0s 16h00. Numa organiza\u00e7\u00e3o exemplar da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Castro Verde<\/strong>, com o apoio t\u00e9cnico da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Beja<\/strong> e das <strong>Juntas de Freguesia de S\u00e3o Marcos da Ataboeira e Entradas<\/strong>, esta cl\u00e1ssica prova alentejana une as duas emblem\u00e1ticas povoa\u00e7\u00f5es numa celebra\u00e7\u00e3o do desporto e das paisagens da Reserva da Biosfera da UNESCO.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida no <strong>Largo do Po\u00e7o<\/strong>, em S\u00e3o Marcos da Ataboeira, e chegada triunfal \u00e0 vila hist\u00f3rica de <strong>Entradas<\/strong>, o evento contempla a <strong>Corrida de 11 km<\/strong> com cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip da <strong>Acorrer<\/strong>, a <strong>Caminhada de 11 km<\/strong> e uma alternativa mais curta de <strong>Caminhada com 7 km<\/strong>. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura transporte pr\u00e9vio e posterior de autocarro entre as localidades, dorsal personalizado, abastecimentos de percurso e meta, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica comemorativa e um caloroso lanche de conv\u00edvio para todos os atletas.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">24 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 16:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Largo do Po\u00e7o, S\u00e3o Marcos da Ataboeira, Castro Verde, Beja<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Corrida 11 km, Caminhada 11 km e Caminhada 7 km<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/stron