ackground: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00f5es Gerais (at\u00e9 18\/10\/2026):<\/strong> 7.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada (Lazer)<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 11 Km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 24 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 16:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00f5es Gerais (at\u00e9 18\/10\/2026):<\/strong> 7.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada (Lazer)<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 7 Km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 24 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 16:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00f5es Gerais (at\u00e9 18\/10\/2026):<\/strong> 7.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio da 8\u00aa Travessia da Plan\u00edcie 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se na tarde de s\u00e1bado, 24 de outubro de 2026, com partida marcada para as 16h00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se localiza a partida e a meta da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A partida situa-se no Largo do Po\u00e7o, em S\u00e3o Marcos da Ataboeira, e a linha de meta est\u00e1 instalada na vila de Entradas, no concelho de Castro Verde (Distrito de Beja).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existe transporte entre as localidades de partida e chegada?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Castro Verde disponibiliza autocarros para transporte de atletas e acompanhantes entre Entradas e S\u00e3o Marcos da Ataboeira antes e ap\u00f3s o evento.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e o valor da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento oferece a Corrida competitiva de 11 km e duas vertentes de Caminhada (11 km e 7 km). A taxa de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00fanica \u00e9 de 7,00 \u20ac na plataforma Acorrer at\u00e9 18 de outubro de 2026.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na Travessia da Plan\u00edcie?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o d\u00e1 direito a dorsal com chip de cronometragem, seguro desportivo, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica do evento, abastecimentos, transporte oficial e lanche conv\u00edvio de encerramento.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"8\u00aa Travessia da Plan\u00edcie 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-24\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Largo do Po\u00e7o, S\u00e3o Marcos da Ataboeira, Castro Verde\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Castro Verde\", \"addressRegion\": \"Beja\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"C\u00e2mara Municipal de Castro Verde\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio da 8\u00aa Travessia da Plan\u00edcie 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se na tarde de s\u00e1bado, 24 de outubro de 2026, com partida marcada para as 16h00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde se localiza a partida e a meta da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A partida situa-se no Largo do Po\u00e7o, em S\u00e3o Marcos da Ataboeira, e a linha de meta est\u00e1 instalada na vila de Entradas, no concelho de Castro Verde (Distrito de Beja).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Existe transporte entre as localidades de partida e chegada?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Castro Verde disponibiliza autocarros para transporte de atletas e acompanhantes entre Entradas e S\u00e3o Marcos da Ataboeira antes e ap\u00f3s o evento.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e o valor da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento oferece a Corrida competitiva de 11 km e duas vertentes de Caminhada (11 km e 7 km). A taxa de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00fanica \u00e9 de 7,00 \u20ac na plataforma Acorrer at\u00e9 18 de outubro de 2026.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na Travessia da Plan\u00edcie?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o d\u00e1 direito a dorsal com chip de cronometragem, seguro desportivo, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica do evento, abastecimentos, transporte oficial e lanche conv\u00edvio de encerramento.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66727,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27],"event_type_2":[728,44,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-66728","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-castro-verde-beja","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type_2-algarve-e-sul","event_type_2-beja","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/travessia-da-planicie-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/66728","targetHints":{"allow